{"task_id": "Mbpp/16", "solution": "import re\n\n# Compile the regex once at module load time for performance.\n# This pattern matches one or more lowercase letters, followed by a single underscore,\n# followed by one or more lowercase letters, for the entire string.\n_LOWERCASE_UNDERSCORE_PATTERN = re.compile(r'^[a-z]+_[a-z]+$')\n\ndef text_lowercase_underscore(text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns true if the input string contains sequences of lowercase letters\n    joined with an underscore and false otherwise, matching the pattern `[a-z]+_[a-z]+`.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Use re.fullmatch to ensure the entire string matches the pattern from start to end.\n    return bool(_LOWERCASE_UNDERSCORE_PATTERN.fullmatch(text))"}
