{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(text):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of non-overlapping occurrences of the string 'std' in the given text.\n    Uses str.find in a loop for efficient counting.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    start = 0\n    pattern = \"std\"\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n    while True:\n        idx = text.find(pattern, start)\n        if idx == -1:\n            break\n        count += 1\n        start = idx + pattern_len\n    return count"}
