{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of elements in two nested tuples.\n    Assumes inputs are well-formed tuples of tuples of integers with matching shapes.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer_tuple = []\n    for inner_tuple_a, inner_tuple_b in zip(a, b):\n        result_inner_tuple = []\n        for elem_a, elem_b in zip(inner_tuple_a, inner_tuple_b):\n            result_inner_tuple.append(elem_a * elem_b)\n        result_outer_tuple.append(tuple(result_inner_tuple))\n    return tuple(result_outer_tuple)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/446", "solution": "def count_Occurrence(items, targets):\n    \"\"\"Counts the total occurrences of elements from 'targets' list within 'items' tuple.\n    Counts each target's occurrences and sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n    unique_targets = []\n    seen_targets = set()\n    for target in targets:\n        if target not in seen_targets:\n            unique_targets.append(target)\n            seen_targets.add(target)\n\n    target_set = set(unique_targets)\n    counts = {target: 0 for target in unique_targets}\n\n    for item in items:\n        if item in target_set:\n            counts[item] += 1\n\n    total_occurrences = sum(counts.values())\n    return total_occurrences"}
